    "description": "Tests code models on C/C++ function-level vulnerability detection with rigorously labeled real-project data. The paired setting asks whether the model can tell a vulnerable function from its patched pair. Papers and cards report accuracy, precision, recall, F1, and paired metrics such as P-C, P-V, P-B, and P-R.",
